          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "મોરચો (morco) is usually traced to Persian mōrča, \"an entrenchment\", a soldiers' word: in Gujarati it is a march of protest, which people કાઢે છે, bring out into the street."
            }
          ]
