          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ગુંજવું (gunjvũ) goes back to Sanskrit guñja, \"humming\", a sound word; CDIAL lists the Hindi cousin gū̃j, an echo, but not the Gujarati verb (CDIAL 4173). A place ગુંજે છે, rings, with voices or music."
            }
